      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRUNKEY CHIEF (3) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from six starts. In the money last time at Bulli (19.29) in a Mix 1/2/3, finishing a 2.5 lengths second. Makes strong appeal on best. ANGEL MEG (1) finds it hard to break through. Finished third (18.92) at Dubbo latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Has a good record at this journey. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from six starts. Expecting another good run. VINTAGE MEL (2) has a strong record here with five wins and three placings from 15 starts. Recorded a 3 length win (18.23) in a Mix 1/2/3 last time at this track. Looks suited here and can measure up. MEPUNGA SHINE (4) hit the frame here last time and looks a chance again.",
